            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMARY</h2><br>Night falls on a group of friends roleplaying together, and as eyelids become heavy, bedtime seems to be the only option.<br>But Sven has another idea. He wants to show his friends an old castle that hasn't been inhabitated for centuries. Good or bad idea?<br>Despite a bit of reluctance from some, the group enters the castle and decides to give it a short visit. What started as a bit of fun is about to become a life-changing event for them. But the real question is: can they make it out of the castle alive?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    6 playable characters<br></li><li>    A battle party of 6 characters simultaneously<br></li><li>    About 4 hours of gameplay<br></li><li>    High production values and quality &quot;dark&quot; atmosphere for a deeper immersion<br></li><li>    Customize your characters - they get different boosts for killing enemy bosses (including optional ones)<br></li><li>    Visible encounters<br></li><li>    Mouse control<br></li><li>    An Halloween tale full of twists and turns<br></li><li>    Grim, immersive atmosphere</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECOMMENDATIONS</h2><br>If you liked this game, you may also like:<br><br><br><br><br><br>",
